<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 1.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JULY 1.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Tuesday, July 1:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,744.10 (1,718.60)	CHF  1,195.00 (1,192.50)</p>
<p>    DEM  1,000.00 (992.66)	  GBP  2,901.20 (2,863.50)</p>
<p>    ATS    142.11 (141.07)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Monday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    N.A.</p>
<p>    Banks sold	N.A.</p>
<p>Total turnover  N.A. ($61.44 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
